{"originalLanguage":"ja","title":"17살의 노래","artist":"『ユイカ』","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:018","sourceHash":"363636fad9ca923d94787e1a20f0fc2f88d7aa97040bb589a8f3fdc70b889381","duration":312.4,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":30.96,"end":36.54,"text":"こんな私の未熟なうたを","translation":"이런 나의 서툰 노래를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":36.54,"end":42.42,"text":"聴いてくれてどうも有難うね。","translation":"들어 줘서 정말 고마워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":42.9,"end":48.3,"text":"もう少しで私は未熟な大人に","translation":"이제 조금만 있으면 나는 서툰 어른이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":48.3,"end":51.68,"text":"なるみたいです。","translation":"되는 모양이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":51.68,"end":54.38,"text":"なんか笑っちゃうね。","translation":"왠지 웃기지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":54.9,"end":56.5,"text":"本当はね、","translation":"사실은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":56.5,"end":60.12,"text":"もっと前を向けるようなうたを","translation":"좀 더 앞을 볼 수 있는 노래를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":60.12,"end":63.98,"text":"書くつもりだったけど、","translation":"쓰려고 했는데","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":63.98,"end":66.44,"text":"書けなくて。","translation":"쓰지 못했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":66.9,"end":68.5,"text":"私はまだ、","translation":"나는 아직","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":68.5,"end":72.38,"text":"他の誰かを支えられるほど","translation":"다른 누군가를 떠받칠 만큼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":72.9,"end":75.98,"text":"強くなかったみたい。","translation":"강하지 않았나 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":75.98,"end":78.4,"text":"ごめんね。","translation":"미안해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":79.72,"end":83.08,"text":"拝啓、未来の私へ。","translation":"미래의 나에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":83.08,"end":85.44,"text":"今そこで","translation":"지금 그곳에서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":85.44,"end":89.04,"text":"どんなことをして","translation":"어떤 일을 하며","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":89.9,"end":91.54,"text":"生きていますか。","translation":"살아가고 있니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":91.54,"end":95.1,"text":"拝啓、今の私へ。","translation":"지금의 나에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":95.1,"end":97.62,"text":"今ここで","translation":"지금 여기서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":97.62,"end":101.1,"text":"どんなことをしたら","translation":"무엇을 해야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":101.1,"end":104.6,"text":"生きていけるんでしょうか。","translation":"살아갈 수 있을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":115.26,"end":119.9,"text":"“好きだからかっこいい”とか","translation":"좋아하니까 멋지다느니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":119.9,"end":121.9,"text":"“そばにいる”とか","translation":"곁에 있다느니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":122.62,"end":125.48,"text":"“勝手に盗んだ”とか","translation":"멋대로 훔쳤다느니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":125.48,"end":127.74,"text":"書いてた。","translation":"쓰곤 했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":128.62,"end":131.6,"text":"“どうせだったらもうちょっと”","translation":"이왕이면 조금만 더","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":132.24,"end":134.06,"text":"貴方みたいに","translation":"너처럼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":135.2,"end":139.98,"text":"やさしいうたを書けばよかったね。","translation":"다정한 노래를 쓸 걸 그랬지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":140.84,"end":142.0,"text":"本当はね、","translation":"사실은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":142.0,"end":145.58,"text":"好きなことだけして生きたいの。","translation":"좋아하는 일만 하며 살고 싶어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":145.58,"end":147.56,"text":"でもそれは","translation":"하지만 그건","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":147.56,"end":151.88,"text":"上手な生き方とは言えないから。","translation":"잘 살아가는 법이라 할 수 없으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":152.36,"end":154.02,"text":"無駄になっても、","translation":"헛일이 되어도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":154.02,"end":155.54,"text":"意味がなくても、","translation":"의미가 없어도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":155.54,"end":157.88,"text":"今はここから","translation":"지금은 여기서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":158.76,"end":161.9,"text":"離れなきゃいけないの。","translation":"떠나야만 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":161.9,"end":163.5,"text":"ごめんね。","translation":"미안해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":163.5,"end":167.1,"text":"拝啓、未来の私へ。","translation":"미래의 나에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":167.1,"end":169.66,"text":"今そこで","translation":"지금 그곳에서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":169.66,"end":172.98,"text":"どんな大人になって","translation":"어떤 어른이 되어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":172.98,"end":175.54,"text":"生きていますか。","translation":"살아가고 있니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":175.54,"end":179.1,"text":"拝啓、今の私へ。","translation":"지금의 나에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":179.1,"end":181.62,"text":"今ここで","translation":"지금 여기서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":181.62,"end":185.56,"text":"どんな大人になりたいと","translation":"어떤 어른이 되고 싶다고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":185.56,"end":188.1,"text":"言えばいいんでしょうか。","translation":"말해야 할까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":188.1,"end":189.48,"text":"「さよなら。」","translation":"안녕","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":189.48,"end":193.96,"text":"は悲しくなるからさ、","translation":"은 슬퍼지니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":194.1,"end":196.58,"text":"「またね。」","translation":"또 보자","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":196.58,"end":199.68,"text":"って言わせて。","translation":"라고 말하게 해 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":200.1,"end":203.12,"text":"いつか私が","translation":"언젠가 내가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":203.12,"end":206.06,"text":"今みたいな","translation":"지금 같은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":206.92,"end":209.5,"text":"うたを書けなくなっても、","translation":"노래를 쓸 수 없게 되어도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":209.5,"end":212.1,"text":"怒らないでね。","translation":"화내지 말아 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":213.7,"end":216.6,"text":"拝啓、過去の私へ。","translation":"과거의 나에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":216.6,"end":219.1,"text":"今の私は","translation":"지금의 나는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":219.1,"end":223.2,"text":"ずっと夢見ていたこと","translation":"줄곧 꿈꾸던 일을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":223.2,"end":225.14,"text":"叶えてるよ。","translation":"이루고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":225.14,"end":228.68,"text":"拝啓、今の私へ。","translation":"지금의 나에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":228.68,"end":231.56,"text":"こんな情けない","translation":"이렇게 한심한","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":232.26,"end":234.52,"text":"うただって歌えばいいよ","translation":"노래라도 부르면 돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":234.52,"end":236.84,"text":"それが私だから。","translation":"그게 나니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":236.84,"end":240.6,"text":"拝啓、未来の私へ。","translation":"미래의 나에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":240.6,"end":243.42,"text":"今そこは","translation":"지금 그곳에는","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":243.42,"end":246.6,"text":"どんな綺麗な世界が","translation":"어떤 아름다운 세상이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":246.6,"end":249.08,"text":"広がっていますか。","translation":"펼쳐져 있니","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":249.08,"end":252.62,"text":"拝啓、今の私へ。","translation":"지금의 나에게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":252.62,"end":255.48,"text":"今ここが","translation":"지금 이곳이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":255.48,"end":258.52,"text":"どんな世界よりも","translation":"어느 세상보다도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":258.52,"end":261.06,"text":"幸せでした。","translation":"행복했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":281.82,"end":288.74,"text":"こんな私の未熟なうたを","translation":"이런 나의 서툰 노래를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":293.34,"end":295.22,"text":"聴いてくれて","translation":"들어 줘서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":295.22,"end":296.82,"text":"どうも有難うね。","translation":"정말 고마워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":296.82,"end":303.26,"text":"これから私は未熟な大人に","translation":"이제부터 나는 서툰 어른이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":303.26,"end":306.76,"text":"なる準備をします。","translation":"될 준비를 할게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":306.76,"end":309.48,"text":"「じゃあ、またね。」","translation":"그럼 또 보자","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}